# The pre-#4890 shape: the flip commits membership and slots but records no
# durable obligation to republish the groups it changed.
MODULE: IntentCoversStaleFlipForgetsIntent
TARGET: IntentCoversStale
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the atomic flip changes membership and slots without persisting the affected-group intent
PERTURBS: Flip

--- FIND
                       /\ intent' = [intent EXCEPT ![k] = Touched(old, new)]
--- REPLACE
                       /\ intent' = intent
--- END
